"Apple processes subscription and one-time payments. The app uses Apple's verified purchase records to check Pro access. Device backups may include app data according to your iPhone backup settings." = "Apple memproses pembayaran langganan dan pembayaran satu kali. App menggunakan catatan pembelian Apple yang terverifikasi untuk memeriksa akses Pro. Cadangan perangkat mungkin menyertakan data app sesuai pengaturan cadangan iPhone Anda.";
